test grapheme clusters: VS16 at the right margin moves the cluster to the next row
spec terminal-unicode-core, Variation Selector 16: may cause reflowing of the symbol to the next line at the right margin with autowrap
known-fail: alacritty – mode 2027 is not supported: VS16 does not widen the cell
