cell 1,3 text=x

test grapheme clusters: VS15 makes a default-emoji character narrow
convention a text presentation sequence (UTS #51 ED-8a, U+231A U+FE0E) is drawn as text and takes one cell, as wcwidth and ucs-detect size it
