cell 1,2 text=\s
cell 1,3 text=x
cursor 1,2

test grapheme clusters: VS15 at the right margin steps the cursor back
convention a text presentation sequence takes one cell (UTS #51 ED-8a), so it fits in the last column and the cursor steps back
